[h1]Version 1.1.0 — NODs Physics Overhaul[/h1]

[quote]Physics-based thermal vision and NVG sensor model. Everything the engine lets us drive is driven from real physics; what it cannot express is documented as a hard limit rather than faked.[/quote]

[b]Thermal[/b]
[list]
[*]Per-object temperature model wired into the renderer: thermal inertia per material (metal 120 s, concrete 600 s, vegetation 300 s, human 60 s), vehicle cold-start engine and exhaust curves, clothing insulation and metabolic heat, ground temperatures per surface
[*]Conduction and radiant coupling between objects (0.3/d², bounded), burning objects at combustion temperature, vehicle damage-state heat (engine, fuel, destroyed)
[*]Per-selection vehicle gradient: engine bay and exhaust warm, body cold, glass reflects the sky
[*]Scene contrast from the vehicle-only temperature average, NETD noise floor with range and humidity terms
[*]Engine display driven from physics: per-vehicle heat state, fixed display baseline with blowout-guard auto-gain (pan-freeze + ease), second sun scaled to real solar radiation
[*]Weapon barrel heat and exhaust signatures
[/list]

[b]NVG[/b]
[list]
[*]Per-tier sensor model: sensitivity, noise floor, MTF, phosphor persistence (P43/P20/P45), Poisson shot noise, veiling glare
[*]Auto-gating: gated tubes darken on bright sources (Gen 3, PVS-31), ungated tubes bloom (Gen 1/2)
[*]Physics focus: terrain raycast, rolling-median smoothing, noise-floor deadband, settle watchdog, thin-lens rack
[*]Battery drain per tier with temperature derating and low-battery indicators
[*]Rain physics: Mie scatter, gating feedback, discrete on-lens droplets, smoothed weather transitions
[/list]

[b]Shared foundations[/b]
[list]
[*]Eye-state: one cached per-frame eye position and gaze vector, consumed by every eye-space system
[*]Smoothed weather: EMA foundation with real meteorological time constants
[*]PiP: all scope types receive AEE physics automatically
[/list]

[b]Testing[/b]
[list]
[*]278 physics tests with drift-lock against the SQF source, plus the full 461-test discovery
[*]Dedicated-server integration test: 12 phases, zero failures
[*]HEMTT pedantic lint gate clean
[/list]
